Note on scaling-relation coefficients
-------------------------------------
The JSON files under scaling_models/ transcribe empirical coefficients from
the peer-reviewed publications cited within each file. Those coefficients are
facts reported in the scientific literature and are not claimed as original
work of this project; the transcription, corrections, encoding and software
are covered by the MIT licence above. Please cite the underlying papers, not
only this tool, when using a given relation.
